          "docs": "Updates a legal entity supplier that is identified by its Yokoy unique ID, replacing all entity-specific attributes. The whole entity is returned. To change the name, address, or contact person for a legal entity supplier, you must update the organization level supplier. Changes to the legal entity supplier are made automatically from the organization supplier."
